'''Struck by Lightning''' (雷に打たれて, ''Kaminari ni Utarete'', '''Struck by Lightning''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

